body:
Hi everyone,

I know that the defaults in `Patch2Self` were changed recently by @arokem, but they won't be visible to the users until the next release. I am making this small PR for adding it to the documentation to ensure that people still use the correct options!

@skoudoro : would it be possible to update the documentation with these changes before the next release?

The following event
```
{
    "id": "aaaa-bbbb",
    "json": "{\"user_id\":null, \"received_at\":\"2021-03-31T10:03:51.966Z\"}"
}
```
should return the following schema:
```
{
    "id": STRING,
    "json": 
        {"received_at": STRING}
}
```
